    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="72">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 72</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And ðær se bunda sæt uncwyd [his deig] ⁊ unbecrafod, sitte þæt wif ⁊ ða cild [on þam ylcan] unbesacan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And when a householder has dwelt all his time free from claims and charges, his wife and children shall dwell [on the same property] unmolested by litigation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And þær se bonda sæt uncwydd ⁊ unbecrafod, sitte þæt wif ⁊ þa cild on þam ylcan unbesacan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
